@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@monolith = http://localhost:8081
@treatment = http://localhost:8082
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
@reminderId = 1010

### Fingerprint — monolith direct, expect 500
GET {{monolith}}/api/reminder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Fingerprint — treatment direct, expect 200
GET {{treatment}}/api/reminder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Gateway, no canary — expect 500, served by the monolith
GET {{gateway}}/api/reminder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Gateway, canary — expect 200, served by treatment
GET {{gateway}}/api/reminder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Canary: treatment

### Gateway, no canary, one reminder — expect 500, monolith
GET {{gateway}}/api/reminder/{{reminderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Gateway, canary, one reminder — expect 200, treatment
GET {{gateway}}/api/reminder/{{reminderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Canary: treatment

### Gateway, canary, user info — expect 500, still the monolith
GET {{gateway}}/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Canary: treatment

### Gateway, canary, entries — expect 500, still the monolith
GET {{gateway}}/api/entry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Canary: treatment

### Gateway, canary, treatment process — expect 500, still the monolith
GET {{gateway}}/api/treatment-process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Canary: treatment

### Real path, no canary — cookie, monolith
GET {{gateway}}/api/reminder
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Real path, canary — cookie, treatment
GET {{gateway}}/api/reminder
Cookie: token={{token}}
X-Canary: treatment

### Real path, canary, create — cookie, treatment
POST {{gateway}}/api/reminder
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}
X-Canary: treatment

{
  "time": "08:00"
}
